   $q$Listen. Rosa's class was getting ready for a song show. At practice, Rosa forgot the words and felt sad. So every night at home, Rosa practiced the song again and again. On the day of the show, Rosa remembered every word, and the crowd clapped and cheered. Rosa took a big bow. What did Rosa practice every night? Tap the picture.$q$, $q$[{"text":"sing","is_correct":true,"tile":{"kind":"object_group","image":"kid_sing","count":1}},{"text":"paint","is_correct":false,"tile":{"kind":"object_group","image":"kid_paint","count":1}},{"text":"read","is_correct":false,"tile":{"kind":"object_group","image":"kid_read","count":1}}]$q$::jsonb, $q$sing$q$, $q$Rosa forgot the words, so Rosa practiced singing the song every night. Rosa kept trying, and on show day Rosa remembered every word.$q$, 'draft', null, 'audio_picture', null)
