   $q$Listen. After the rain, a little pink worm wiggled up out of the wet dirt. A hungry bird hopped across the grass, looking for food. The worm saw the bird coming and quickly wiggled back down into its hole. The bird pecked at some seeds on the ground instead, and then it flew up to its nest. Who wiggled back into a hole? Tap the picture.$q$, $q$[{"text":"snake","is_correct":false,"tile":{"kind":"object_group","image":"snake","count":1}},{"text":"bird","is_correct":false,"tile":{"kind":"object_group","image":"bird","count":1}},{"text":"worm","is_correct":true,"tile":{"kind":"object_group","image":"worm","count":1}}]$q$::jsonb, $q$worm$q$, $q$The little worm saw the bird and wiggled back down into its hole. The bird ate seeds instead.$q$, 'draft', null, 'audio_picture', null)
