   $q$What is the author's opinion?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Families should keep their old books.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-text"},{"text":"Students should read only at their desks.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-text"},{"text":"Every classroom should have a reading corner.","is_correct":true},{"text":"The school should buy many new rugs.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"too-narrow"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Every classroom should have a reading corner.$q$, $q$The author says in the first and last paragraphs that every classroom should have a reading corner. The rugs are only one small part of the third reason, not the main opinion.$q$, 'draft', '09726f58-fc64-5103-a671-8479e5099902')
