   $q$Why did many ships crash near Gull Point long ago?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Sailors could not see the hidden rocks at night.","is_correct":true},{"text":"The lighthouse lamp was too bright.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"confuses-cause-effect"},{"text":"The keeper forgot to ring the bell.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"The ships were sailing too far from shore.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-text"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Sailors could not see the hidden rocks at night.$q$, $q$The first paragraph says sharp rocks were hidden close to shore and "At night, sailors could not see them." The lighthouse was built later to fix this problem, so it was not the cause.$q$, 'draft', '90a72bfa-0f97-5954-902f-4462d97e736a')
