   $q$According to the second paragraph, how are penguins and puffins alike?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Both can fly fast over the waves.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"overgeneralizes"},{"text":"Both live in the northern half of the world.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"overgeneralizes"},{"text":"Both swim well and have thick, warm feathers.","is_correct":true},{"text":"Both have bright orange beaks in spring.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"overgeneralizes"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Both swim well and have thick, warm feathers.$q$, $q$The second paragraph says both birds are excellent swimmers and both have thick feathers. Only puffins can fly, so flying is a difference, not a likeness.$q$, 'draft', '93f7e269-392d-5072-bd4b-5deb3fc38102')
