   $q$What does the author want readers to believe?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Recess at the school should be thirty minutes long.","is_correct":true},{"text":"Recess at the school should be taken away.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"reverses-opinion"},{"text":"Students should spend more time on math.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"confuses-counterclaim"},{"text":"The playground needs new climbing equipment.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Recess at the school should be thirty minutes long.$q$, $q$The author says, "I think recess should be thirty minutes long," and asks readers to tell the principal. More math time is what "some people" want, not the author.$q$, 'draft', '0339b23f-cd0f-5797-ac3c-9eabfd5d3500')
