-- Passage rg3-authors-purpose-p08
insert into public.passages (id, code, skill_id, sat_alignment, grade_band, title, body, status)
values ('54da108e-40b5-5a45-96d7-9bc7a7a961d1', 'rg3-authors-purpose-p08', (select id from public.skills where slug = 'read-g3-authors-purpose'), null,
        '3-5', $q$Winter Is the Best Season$q$, $q$Many people say summer is the best time of year. They love warm days and long trips to the pool. I disagree. I believe winter is the best season of all.

First, winter brings snow. Snow turns the whole neighborhood bright and white. You can build a snow fort, sled down a hill or catch snowflakes on your tongue. No other season gives you a playground that falls from the sky.

Second, winter is cozy. After playing outside, I love to sit by a warm window with a cup of hot cocoa. My family reads books together under thick blankets. Cold days make warm moments feel even better.

Third, winter is a great time to watch animals. Their tracks are easy to spot in fresh snow. Last winter, I found tiny bird prints and the bigger tracks of a rabbit outside my door.

Summer has its fun, but winter has magic. This year, when the first snow falls, step outside and see for yourself.$q$, 'draft')
